# Local environment template
#
# SOC Investigation Lab does not require application-specific environment
# variables at the v0.1.0 foundation stage.
#
# When local configuration variables are introduced, document safe example
# values here and copy this file to `.env` for local use.
#
# Never place real credentials, secrets, production values, personal data,
# or corporate environment data in this file.
#
# Local `.env` files must remain untracked.
